The two cleanest modern ways to center a div are **Flexbox** and **CSS Grid**:

### Method 1: CSS Grid (Shortest & Cleanest)
```css
.parent {
  display: grid;
  place-items: center;
  height: 100vh; /* or any height */
}
```

### Method 2: Flexbox
```css
.parent {
  display: flex;
  justify-content: center; /* horizontal */
  align-items: center;     /* vertical */
  height: 100vh;
}
```
Both methods are Baseline widely available across all modern browsers.

